rch integration, multi-repository code review, and improved image editing capabilities.\n   360→                    </div>\n   361→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   362→                        <span class=\"update-badge update-feature\">Feature</span>\n   363→                        <span>July 30, 2026</span>\n   364→                        <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\">Changelog →</a>\n   365→                    </div>\n   366→                </div>\n   367→\n   368→                <div class=\"item\">\n   369→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   370→                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini CLI v0.53.0</a>\n   371→                    </div>\n   372→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   373→                        LLM triage orchestrator for automated issue categorization, evaluation coverage reporting, and macOS Seatbelt profiles security alignment.\n   374→                    </div>\n   375→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   376→                        <span class=\"update-badge update-feature\">Feature</span>\n   377→                        <span>July 28, 2026</span>\n   378→                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\">Changelog →</a>\n   379→                    </div>\n   380→                </div>\n   381→\n   382→                <div class=\"item\">\n   383→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   384→                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor Start</a>\n   385→                    </div>\n   386→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   387→                        New offering announced by Cursor, expanding their product line for developers getting started with AI-assisted coding.\n   388→                    </div>\n   389→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   390→                        <span class=\"update-badge