rget=\"_blank\">Codex CLI v0.145.0</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Experimental features including paginated thread history with efficient resume and search, migration from Cursor and Claude Code environments, Amazon Bedrock integration, and audio inputs with realtime V3 conversations.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-badge update-feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span>July 21, 2026</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\">Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://continue.dev\" target=\"_blank\">Continue Acquisition</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Continue was acquired by Cursor, with the mission to ensure developers are amplified rather than automated continuing at Cursor.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-badge update-announcement\">Announcement</span>\n                        <span>July 15, 2026</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://continue.dev\">Details →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini CLI v0.50.0</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        System architecture improvements implementing automatic tool registry discovery, enhanced release verification, and preventing binary shadowing.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-badge update-feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span>July 8, 2026</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\">Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Grok 4.5 for Cursor</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New AI model announcement bringing Grok 4.5's capabilities to Cursor's development environment.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-badge update-feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span>July 8, 2026</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/\">Details →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Right Column: Technical Insights -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n                <h2>Technical Insights</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\">Qwen3.8 Max Ranked Best Overall Model</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        The Qwen3.8 Max model topped the agentic index rankings, marking a significant milestone for open-source models.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>HN</span>\n                        <span>Aug 7, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Qwen</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">benchmarks</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agentic AI</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\">Humans Miss 33% of Threats in AI Agent Approvals</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Study of 40,000 game runs revealed humans fail to catch 1 in 3 threats when approving AI agent actions, raising significant safety concerns about human-in-the-loop systems.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>HN</span>\n                        <span>Aug 7, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI safety</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">security</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agents</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\">Inside vLLM: High-Throughput LLM Inference</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Technical deep dive into vLLM's architecture for efficient LLM inference, discussing system design and performance optimizations.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>HN</span>\n                        <span>Aug 7, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">vLLM</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">inference</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">performance</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\">AMD Acquires Taalas for Inference Performance</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        AMD acquired Taalas, a startup focused on etching AI models directly into silicon for improved inference performance.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>HN</span>\n                        <span>Aug 7, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AMD</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">hardware</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">inference</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\">Channels SDK: Multi-Platform Agent Integration</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New SDK for integrating AI agents across platforms like Slack and MS Teams, enabling multi-platform agent deployment.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>HN</span>\n                        <span>Aug 7, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">SDK</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Slack</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\">Herdr Joins Y Combinator, Runtime Stays Open Source</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Herdr joins Y Combinator with their runtime remaining open source - positive signal for open source infrastructure tools.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>HN</span>\n                        <span>Aug 7, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Y Combinator</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open source</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">infrastructure</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\">Whisper Age Bias in Speech Recognition</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Research showing ASR age bias in speech recognition systems, with Whisper performing better on older speakers.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>HN</span>\n                        <span>Aug 7, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Whisper</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">bias</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI fairness</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://softwareengineeringdaily.com\" target=\"_blank\">Terminal as Agentic Interface</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Software Engineering Daily explores how the terminal is emerging as a natural home for agentic development as AI becomes central to developer workflows.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>Podcast</span>\n                        <span>Aug 6, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">terminal</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">tooling</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://softwareengineeringdaily.com\" target=\"_blank\">AI Supply Chain Security Threats</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Software Engineering Daily discusses AI, security, and software supply chain threats, covering emerging risks in the AI era.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>Podcast</span>\n                        <span>Aug 4, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">security</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">supply chain</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">Argus: Long-Horizon Reasoning Framework</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Presents a framework for 'long-horizon reasoning' in AI agents, enabling extended task planning and execution over complex workflows.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>ArXiv</span>\n                        <span>Aug 6, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">reasoning</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">task planning</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">ContextWeave: Real-World Workflow Benchmark</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Introduces a benchmark for evaluating AI performance on complex multi-step workflows in practical settings.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>ArXiv</span>\n                        <span>Aug 6, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">benchmarks</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflows</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">evaluation</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">FinPerMA: Memory Benchmark for LLM Agents</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Develops a memory benchmark specifically designed for LLM agents to assess personalized information retention and retrieval.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>ArXiv</span>\n                        <span>Aug 6, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">memory</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">benchmarks</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">FinProBench: Financial AI Agent Evaluation</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Creates evaluation metrics for AI agents in professional financial contexts using role-based assessment criteria.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>ArXiv</span>\n                        <span>Aug 6, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">evaluation</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">financial AI</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">A/B Agent: Self-Evolving Strategy System</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Describes an autonomous agent system that iteratively improves testing strategies in industrial A/B testing scenarios.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>ArXiv</span>\n                        <span>Aug 6, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">A/B testing</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">self-improving</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">Architectural Implications of Agentic Workflows</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Analyzes system architecture requirements for 'agentic AI workflows,' focusing on computational infrastructure for autonomous agent systems.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>ArXiv</span>\n                        <span>Aug 6, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">architecture</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">infrastructure</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/papers/trending\" target=\"_blank\">LongHorizon-Harness: MEA Framework</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Manage-Execute-Audit loop improves agents from 51.8% to 80.7% on WeaveBench with gains across multiple agent frameworks.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>HuggingFace</span>\n                        <span>Aug 3, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">benchmarks</span>\n                        <s