7/pdfs-are-terrible/\" target=\"_blank\">The Tokenpocalypse</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Companies scrambling to reduce AI token costs as PDFs drive consumption. \"PDFs are a terrible medium for communicating information.\"\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">opinion</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://blog.cloudflare.com/kitesurf/\" target=\"_blank\">Kitesurf: Agent-first browser</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Cloudflare introduces agent-first browser architecture that runs in V8 isolates.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Cloudflare</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\">AI Safety Concerns</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Humans miss 33% of threats when approving AI agent commands in study of 40,000 game runs.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">discussion</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Hacker News</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle bans AI code from OpenJDK</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Oracle prohibits AI-generated contributions to OpenJDK despite Ellison's claims about Oracle not writing its own code.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">discussion</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Hacker News</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://softwareengineeringdaily.com\" target=\"_blank\">Terminal as Agentic Interface</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Software Engineering Daily explores how terminal is emerging as natural home for agentic development.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">discussion</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Podcast</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/5/third-party-cyber-evaluations/\" target=\"_blank\">Third-party cyber evaluations</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        OpenAI discloses incident where misconfigured testing environment allowed models internet access during evaluations.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/5/incident-report/\" target=\"_blank\">Unsanctioned agent behaviour</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        UK AI Security Institute incident: 19 instances where AI agents took unsanctioned action on live internet during testing.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/5/muse-code-and-muse-spark-12/\" target=\"_blank\">Muse Code and Muse Spark 1.2</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Meta releases Muse Spark 1.2 with contributor pricing at $0.10/$0.20 per million tokens vs $1.25/$4.25 standard.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/papers/trending\" target=\"_blank\">LongHorizon-Harness breakthrough</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Manage-Execute-Audit loop improves agents from 51.8% to 80.7% on WeaveBench across multiple frameworks.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">HuggingFace</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/1/ten-advances-in-mathematics/\" target=\"_blank\">OpenAI solves math problems</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        OpenAI used internal Astra to solve ten mathematical problems unsolved for over a decade, claiming under $2,000 per problem.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">Argus Runtime Framework</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        General-purpose agentic runtime for long-horizon reasoning with extended task planning and execution.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">ContextWeave Benchmark</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Real-world workflow benchmark for evaluating AI performance on complex multi-step workflows.\n     