ignal for infrastructure tools.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">discussion</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Hacker News</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\">Whisper bias research</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Research shows Whisper transcribes 70-year-olds more accurately than 20-year-olds, revealing ASR age bias.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">discussion</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Hacker News</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">FinPerMA Memory Benchmark</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Personalized-memory benchmark specifically designed for LLM agents to assess information retention.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">DASH Self-Distillation</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Divergence-adaptive supervision horizons for on-policy self-distillation of reasoning models.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">TS-RAG for Time Series</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Retrieval augmented generation techniques applied to time series forecasting.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">EnvACE World Rehearsal</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Internalizing environment dynamics via world rehearsal for agentic reinforcement learning.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">AppDeltaWorld for Mobile GUI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Transition-grounded delta code world model designed