ed for mobile GUI agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/4/new-release-of-llm/\" target=\"_blank\">LLM 0.32 Released</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Most significant release since launch with visible reasoning traces, server-side tools, redesigned SQLite logs.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net\" target=\"_blank\">Raccoon Heist Game</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        One-shotting a complete game using Claude Fable 5 from a single tweet demonstrates rapid prototyping capabilities.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://softwareengineeringdaily.com\" target=\"_blank\">AI Supply Chain Threats</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Software Engineering Daily discusses AI-powered threats to the software supply chain.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">discussion</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Podcast</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\">OpenAI Cyber Capabilities</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        OpenAI discusses cybersecurity capabilities and approach to critical infrastructure protection.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">discussion</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">OpenAI</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\">vLLM Architecture Deep Dive</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Technical deep dive into vLLM's architecture for efficient LLM inference and performance optimizations.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Hacker News</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arcprize.org/results/deepseek-v4-flash-0731\" target=\"_blank\">DeepSeek V4 Flash Results</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New AI model results posted to ARC Prize leaderboard showing continued benchmarking improvements.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">discussion</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Hacker News</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/papers/trending\" target=\"_blank\">Agent-Centric World Proxies</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Conceptualizes agent-centric interactive world proxies shifting from physical state to agent-usable information transitions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">HuggingFace</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">Agent Retrieval Approaches</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Comparative analysis of approaches to agent retrieval over large skill libraries.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">A/B Agent Self-Evolution</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Self-evolving agent for strategy iteration in industrial A/B testing scenarios.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">Architectural Implications</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Analyzes system architecture requirements for agentic AI workflows and autonomous agent systems.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">Poli-Bias Research</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Understanding and measuring LLM biases in international political conflicts.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">AgentOPSD Self-Distillation</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Recursive self-distillation approach specifically for agentic reinforcement learning.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">Skill Contamination Research</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Addresses skill contamination in self-evolving LLM agents through pre-commit gating mechanisms.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">HarnessOpt-Bench</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Benchmark for evaluating LLMs specifically at harness optimization tasks.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" target=\"_blank\">FinProBench for Financial AI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Creates evaluation metrics for AI agents in professional financial contexts using role-based assessment.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net\" target=\"_blank\">datasette-apps 0.2a0</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added app_debug() tool allowing agents to test apps using JavaScript in invisible iframes.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net\" target=\"_blank\">Muse Spark Long Sequences</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Simon highlights that long-sequence agentic tool calling is now the most important model characteristic.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Simon Willison</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <p>Report generated by <a href=\"#\">Agent Code Daily</a> - Powered by Claude Agent SDK</p>\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 5px; color: #828282;\">\n                <a href=\"#new-products\">New Products</a> |\n                <a href=\"#whitelist-updates\">Whitelist Updates</a> |\n                <a href=\"#technical-insights\">Technical Insights</a>\n            </p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
